  <AltText>
    Sprite of CuteDarkArts' OC, Posie. She is a demon with green skin with pointed ears and prominent horns adorned with metal rings. She is wearing a brown cross strap top with a dark green skirt, and brown thigh-high boots.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    A sprite of Posie.
    I tried to get as much of her details in there as I could, and I like how it turned out.
    I hope you like it ^w^
